    <div class="container">
      <div class="head">
        <h2 id="depth-title" class="display-m" data-split>You choose <em>the depth.</em></h2>
        <p class="body-l head__intro" data-reveal>Most couples go for The whole way. Some start with Connecting heart and sex or a little sniff first. All good.</p>
      </div>
      <PriceTable packages={packages} />
      <p class="body-s prices__small" data-reveal>In Lisbon or I come to you at the same price. Payment plans with no surcharge: two instalments for the sniff, three for Connecting heart and sex, up to six for The whole way. Already walked Connecting heart and sex? Continue with Erotic craft on its own: {c.craft.hours} hours · {euro(c.craft.price)}.</p>
