          <p>In Erotic craft, I hand you skills. Here, I take you somewhere. This is where the three of us play (for the sake of education). I'm in it with you: I hold the space, I lead and I teach with my own body as well as my words. Mutual touch can be part of it, always negotiated in detail and agreed in writing before we begin. In my space only.</p>
          <p>Two paths. Walk one in {c.deepEndOnePath.hours} hours or both in {c.deepEndBothPaths.hours}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Doors paths={paths} />
      <div class="prose prose--wide after-acc" data-stagger>
